{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47718","headline":"登杭州秦望山 · 马湘","name":"登杭州秦望山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太乙初分何处寻，空留历数变人心。\n九天日月移朝暮，万里山川换古今。\n风动水光吞远峤，雨添岚气没高林。\n秦皇谩作驱山计，沧海茫茫转更深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马湘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}